    },
    {
      "id": "claim_40e4a8810b6e42cb825233ed23e23c9e",
      "statement": "The referral matrix and Personal Lines Underwriting Manual are separate internal sources: the matrix has its own water-backup-over-$25,000 and two-paid-property-claims-in-three-years positions, while Manual Rules 310, 320, and 900 have separate referral, no-clearance, and appendix positions; these thresholds and outcomes must not be silently merged with the Binding Authority and Exceptions guideline.",
